<title>POLAND: Rafako turns to PLN 4.2 mln loss in Q2.</title>
<headline>Rafako turns to PLN 4.2 mln loss in Q2.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Rafako preliminary results for the second quarter of the year ending June 30, 1997.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>						Q2 1997	Q2 1996</p>
<p>    operating profit		    15.40   vs    9.69</p>
<p>    pre-tax loss			   4.16   vs    5.45 profit</p>
<p>    net loss				 4.16   vs    5.45 profit</p>
<p>NOTE - full company name is: Fabryka Kotlow Rafako SA.</p>
<p>    net sales			     75.26   vs   98.58</p>
<p>    costs of sales			57.76   vs   72.02</p>
<p>@</p>
<p>    extraordinary loss		  16.20   vs    0.04 profit</p>
<p>    financial revenues		  12.03   vs    3.47</p>
<p>    financial costs		     15.39   vs    7.74</p>
<p>    investment			     0.15   vs    2.62</p>
<p>						H1 1997	H1 1996</p>
<p>    operating profit		    10.09   vs   15.47</p>
<p>    pre-tax loss			  11.67   vs    8.16 profit</p>
<p>    net loss				11.67   vs    8.16 profit</p>
<p>    net sales			    152.64   vs  196.61</p>
<p>    costs of sales		     128.02   vs  164.68</p>
<p>@</p>
<p>    extraordinary loss		  16.20   vs    0.04 profit</p>
<p>    financial revenues		  17.15   vs    4.00</p>
<p>    financial costs		     22.71   vs   11.35</p>
<p>    investment			     0.59   vs    4.69</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
